	(text "U6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO'nun TEK beslemesi. Ferrit boncuk, ayri toprak adasi.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "395899a8-6afc-4885-ace5-860fe6cd141c")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44edee27-29eb-4e8c-942e-0956d808b476")
	)
	(text "FPGA CEKIRDEK +1V1 — TPS62130 #2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ece170e-3b28-41ea-aa5a-fd4619146504")
	)
	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5340c8b8-46ba-4b78-83da-a40035ce69a3")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c6c3404-4ee6-41f9-8adc-ed1a21e996ff")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88083629-e1c4-4e9f-a6d5-058248612051")
	)
	(text "ANA RAY +3V3 — TPS62130, 3-17V giris, 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "967cbeea-d046-4aca-889d-efe92ab725ab")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8 x (1 + R3/R4).  3.3V icin oran 3.125\nL1, Cin ve Cout datasheet Tablo 8'den."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a8f7a0cb-e5c1-41f0-a7c0-7aed625154f3")
	)
	(text "AYRISTIRMA (NETLIST.md §1)\nher ECP5 VCC/VCCIO topu 100nF, viasi dogrudan duzleme · ECP5 toplu 4x10uF + 2x47uF\nADC AVDD x8 pin basina 100nF + toplu 10uF · ADC DRVDD x4 100nF\nVCXO 100nF + 10uF + FERRIT BONCUK · PHY 10uF X5R  (Y5V KULLANMA, datasheet s.46-53)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a940fcbc-870f-49af-b3ed-bc96ab3373c4")
	)
	(text "1.1V icin oran 0.375.  EN zinciri: U1 PG -> U2 EN,\nguc siralamasi VCC(1.1) once, sonra VCCAUX, sonra VCCIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b1166676-cbdd-4a56-a5b3-887ac4be60cf")
	)
	(text "GIRIS VE KORUMA — NETLIST.md §9\n9-18 V aku ya da tezgah kaynagi. Ters polarite sahada bir kere olur, yeter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c18a87f5-d544-4374-9666-80ad62795488")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c98293cf-1bb7-4063-892a-9264670d84ac")
	)
	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cf30fa9e-fc57-4b2d-805d-37575d2f910e")
	)
